# Jarvis core

Local work HUD. Prefer existing modules; do not invent a parallel stack.

## Stack (locked)

| Layer | Tech | Ports / paths |
| ----- | ---- | ------------- |
| HUD | Next.js + Tailwind (`frontend/`) | `:3000` |
| API | FastAPI (`backend/app/`) | `127.0.0.1:8000` preferred |
| DB | SQLite `<repo>/data/jarvis.db` (`.env` `DATA_DIR=./data`, resolved from repo root) | — |
| Memory/RAG | SQLite + LanceDB under `backend/data/memory/` | — |
| Brain | Hermes gateway `:8642` first; Gemini/Ollama fallback | — |
| TTS | Voicebox `:17493` via `POST /generate` (not `/speak`) | browser plays once |
| React Bits | Vendored in `frontend/src/components/react-bits/` | accents only |

## Non-negotiables

- Tools own mail/calendar/files/Drive. Brain never invents prices, mail, or calendar facts.
- HITL (**Authorize / Shall I**) before send mail, Task for Gemini, calendar writes, quote send, broad memory wipe.
- Files only under `backend/exports`.
- Max **3** expanded Open notes (`MAX_EXPANDED = 3`).
- Prefer `127.0.0.1:8000` (avoid ghost `0.0.0.0:8000` listeners).
- Never commit `.env`, `google_token.json`, `jarvis.db`, or secrets.

## HUD shape

- Shell: `OrchestratorShell` (not HudShell for primary desk).
- Right column: `WeatherCard` (shrink-0) + scrollable `SuggestedTasksPanel`.
- Mail board: `SpotlightCard` with scroll on `bodyClassName`, not the outer card.
- Voice: `frontend/src/lib/voice.ts` — bridge browser TTS; Voicebox cutover ≤~1.4s; late clips must not replay.

